# .trivyignore
# Known upstream Debian Bookworm system package vulnerabilities with no fix available in Debian repositories.
# The mailtmapi application itself and its Python direct dependencies are unaffected.

# msgpack: Denial of Service via memory leak during map deserialization
CVE-2026-114613

# setuptools: Path Traversal Vulnerability in setuptools PackageIndex
CVE-2025-47273

# urllib3: Traffic interception via HTTPS proxy TLS configuration override
CVE-2026-97687

# urllib3: Denial of Service via unbounded memory allocation in chunk parser
CVE-2026-97689
